we have created unique machines and materials to package your products in the most sustainable way.", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/notpla", "profiles": ["crunchbase.com/organization/notpla", "twitter.com/notpla", "linkedin.com/company/notpla", "linkedin.com/company/20344289", "facebook.com/notpla"], "employee_count_by_country": {"chile": 1, "finland": 1, "france": 2, "germany": 1, "hong kong": 1, "italy": 1, "saudi arabia": 1, "united arab emirates": 1, "united kingdom": 68, "united states": 1}, "likelihood": 6, "dataset_version": "35.2", "location": "london, england, united kingdom"}

{"display_name": "Clear Robotics", "size": "1-10", "employee_count": 21, "founded": 2019, "industry": "internet", "industry_v2": "technology, information and internet", "type": "private", "headline": "We deliver bold ideas and AI-powered technology solutions to resolve complex environmental challenges.", "summary": "at clearbot, we're revolutionizing the way we clean our oceans with our advanced robotic technology. our team of experts combines cutting-edge sensors and computing to build highly innovative electric boats that are designed for maximum mobility, perception, and agility.

we specialize in build-test-build engineering and field testing to ensure our prototypes meet the highest standards of performance and reliability. our world-class development teams are constantly pushing the limits of what's possible, with the goal of transforming successful designs into robot products that have the power to change the world.

our passion for sustainability drives everything we do, and we're committed to harnessing the power of robotics to make our oceans cleaner and healthier for generations to come. join us as we work to change the world, one robot at a time.", "linkedin_url": "linkedin.com/company/clearrobotics", "profiles": ["linkedin.com/company/clearbothk", "facebook.com/clearbot", "crunchbase.com/organization/clearbot-3754", "linkedin.com/company/42751269", "linkedin.com/company/clearrobotics"], "employee_count_by_country": {"hong kong": 6, "india": 12, "other_uncategorized": 1, "singapore": 1, "united arab emirates": 1}, "likelihood": 6, "dataset_version": "35.2", "location": "hong kong island, hong kong"}
